<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Thank you | Kavach Consultancy</title>
<meta name="description" content="Your enquiry has reached Kavach Consultancy. We usually reply on WhatsApp within 2 hours during working hours.">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
